<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>For You 🤍</title>

<style>
@import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@400;600&display=swap');

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  font-family: 'Quicksand', sans-serif;
}

body {
  margin: 0;
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: repeating-linear-gradient(
    45deg,
    #ffd6e7,
    #ffd6e7 10px,
    #ffe6f0 10px,
    #ffe6f0 20px
  );
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}

.container {
  width: 90%;
  max-width: 380px;
  background: #fff0f6;
  border-radius: 25px;
  padding: 25px;
  box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  text-align: center;
}

.hidden {
  display: none;
}

.card {
  animation: fade 0.5s ease;
}

h1 {
  color: #ff6fa5;
  font-size: 22px;
}

p {
  color: #555;
  font-size: 15px;
  line-height: 1.6;
}

button {
  margin-top: 20px;
  padding: 12px 22px;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 30px;
  background: #ff6fa5;
  color: white;
  font-size: 14px;
  cursor: pointer;
}

button:hover {
  background: #ff4f90;
}

.envelope {
  width: 160px;
  margin: 15px auto;
}

.letter {
  max-height: 300px;
  overflow-y: auto;
  padding: 10px;
  text-align: left;
}

@keyframes fade {
  from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
  to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

  <!-- SCREEN 1 -->
  <div id="screen1" class="card">
    <h1>For you 🤍</h1>
    <p>Click the button to open something special</p>
    <button onclick="next(2)">Open</button>
  </div>

  <!-- SCREEN 2 -->
  <div id="screen2" class="card hidden">
    <img class="envelope" src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/561/561127.png">
    <p>Do you want to open it?</p>
    <button onclick="next(3)">Yes</button>
  </div>

  <!-- SCREEN 3 -->
  <div id="screen3" class="card hidden">
    <h1>My letter 💗</h1>
    <div class="letter">
      <p>
        I remember the time when I wasn't looking for love. I was focused on getting through my days and figuring things out on my own but then you came into my life and everything felt different and that makes it special. I can't imagine my life without you, sinanay mo kong nanjan ka palagi para sakin.
        <br><br>
        I'm very grateful to have you and how perfectly unexpected you are. Loving you wasn’t something I chased, it simply happened, and it feels real in a way nothing else ever did.
        <br><br>
        When life isn't being kind to you, always remember na nandito lang ako palagi kasama mo. You don't have to face it alone, we'll face it together, ga. I love you, forever.
        <br><br>
        Love,<br>
        <strong>AD</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
function next(n) {
  document.querySelectorAll('.card').forEach(c => c.classList.add('hidden'));
  document.getElementById('screen' + n).classList.remove('hidden');
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
